module NexusHud.V5
# v5 deck kit. Singletons only in Wave 0 (C1 SCAFFOLD).
# The integrator owns this file. Component cards never edit it: they add their
# own .qml file and ask for the one registration line in their PR body.
singleton Tokens 1.0 Tokens.qml
singleton Motion 1.0 Motion.qml
# Wave 1 registrations land below this line, one per component card.
# I1 (integrator) registers every component that exists on v5/main-deck, with
# the line each PR body asked for. Order: renderer, centre, orbit widgets,
# gauges, icons, launcher, find, environment.
Swarm 1.0 Swarm.qml
SwarmSphere 1.0 SwarmSphere.qml
Knot 1.0 Knot.qml
CrewOrb 1.0 CrewOrb.qml
PulseRing 1.0 PulseRing.qml
DotArc 1.0 DotArc.qml
DotBar 1.0 DotBar.qml
LocalOrb 1.0 LocalOrb.qml
IconTile 1.0 IconTile.qml
LauncherArc 1.0 LauncherArc.qml
FindField 1.0 FindField.qml
FindResults 1.0 FindResults.qml
Clock 1.0 Clock.qml
Focus 1.0 Focus.qml
IdleDrift 1.0 IdleDrift.qml
QuickActions 1.0 QuickActions.qml
MediaPill 1.0 MediaPill.qml
# kit/icons/* is deliberately NOT registered (W4, PR #38): IconTile reaches the
# 17 glyphs with `import "icons" as Icons` and Glyph maps a key to a Component,
# so this file grows by two lines instead of nineteen and a deck of nine tiles
# instantiates nine glyphs, not seventeen. The glyphs are library files, not
# public types.
